{"id":"taman_o","lemma":"tamaño","pos":"adj","rank":1292,"glosses":["as big or small; equivalent in size; so big/so small; such a big/small"],"ipa":"/taˈmaɲo/","forms":{"feminine":"tamaña","masculinePlural":"tamaños","femininePlural":"tamañas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e0/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-tama%C3%B1o.wav","examples":[{"text":"El tamaño no importa.","en":"Size doesn't matter.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636480"},{"text":"No puede haber dicho tamaña estupidez.","en":"He can't have said such a stupid thing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609075"},{"text":"Tengo martillos de varios tamaños.","en":"I have hammers of different sizes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567564"},{"text":"Es del tamaño perfecto.","en":"It's the perfect size.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461543"},{"text":"Estas pinturas son de tamaños distintos.","en":"These paintings are different sizes."}]}